post_install() {
  cat <<'NOTICE'
WeTypeX Omarchy adapter installed. No runtime, account or desktop was activated.
Read /usr/share/doc/fcitx5-wetypex/ARCH.md for official-runtime preparation,
input-method configuration, user-service activation, update and rollback.
Existing per-user installations can shadow this package: run wetypex-omarchy-setup status.
NOTICE
}
post_upgrade() { post_install; }
